<title>SPAIN: TENNIS-MARBELLA WORLD SERIES TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MARBELLA WORLD SERIES TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MARBELLA, Spain 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results in</p>
<p>the Marbella world series men's tennis tournament on Thursday.</p>
<p>Marcos Aurelio Gorriz (Spain) beat Carlos Costa (Spain) 7-5 6-4</p>
<p>4-Alex Corretja (Spain) beat Johan van Herck (Belgium) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Marcelo Filippini (Uruguay) beat Franco Squillari (Argentina)</p>
<p>5-7 6-3 7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>Bernd Karbacher (Germany) beat Galo Blanco (Spain) 4-6 7-5 6-3</p>
</text>
